"Kup is not enabled, enable it from the system settings module. You can do "
"that by running <command>kcmshell6 kup</command>"
msgstr ""
"Kup er ikkje slått på. Slå systemet på i modulen i system­innstillingane. Du "
"kan gjera det ved å køyra kommandoen <command>kcmshell6 kup</command>."

#: daemon/main.cpp:37
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@title"
msgid "Kup Daemon"
msgstr "Kup-teneste"

#: daemon/main.cpp:39
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Kup is a flexible backup solution using the backup storage system 'bup'. "
"This allows it to quickly perform incremental backups, only saving the parts "
"of files that has actually changed since last backup was saved."
msgstr ""
"Kup er eit fleksibelt system for reservekopiering av data via programmet "
"«bup». Dette gjer det mogleg å gjera rask, inkrementell reserve­kopiering, "
"der ein berre treng kopiera filene som er endra sidan sist."

