msgstr "Gjenopprettar manglande filer …"

#: fileitemaction/fileitemaction.cpp:63
#, kde-format
msgid "Restore Previous Version…"
msgstr "Gjenopprettar førre versjon …"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:281
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Exclude Folder"
msgstr "Utelat mappe"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:284
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Include Folder"
msgstr "Ta med mappe"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:385
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info message bar appearing on top"
msgid ""
"You don't have permission to read this folder: <filename>%1</filename><nl/"
">It cannot be included in the source selection. If it does not contain "
"anything important to you, one possible solution is to exclude the folder "
"from the backup plan."
msgstr ""
"Du har ikkje løyve til å lesa denne mappa: <filename>%1</filename><nl/>Ho "
"kan derfor ikkje takast med i kjeldeutvalet. Viss mappa ikkje inneheld noko "
"som er viktig for deg, er ei løysinga å utelata mappa frå utvalet."

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:396
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info message bar appearing on top"
msgid ""
"You don't have permission to read this file: <filename>%1</filename><nl/>It "
"cannot be included in the source selection. If the file is not important to "
"you, one possible solution is to exclude the whole folder where the file is "
"stored from the backup plan."
msgstr ""
"Du har ikkje løyve til å lesa denne fila: <filename>%1</filename><nl/>Ho kan "
"derfor ikkje takast med i kjeldeutvalet. Viss fila ikkje er viktig for deg, "
"er ei løysinga å utelata mappa der fila ligg, frå utvalet."

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:412
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info message bar appearing on top"
msgid ""
"The symbolic link <filename>%1</filename> points to a folder which is not "
"included: <filename>%2</filename>.<nl/>That is probably not what you want. "
"One solution is to simply include the target folder in the backup plan."
msgstr ""
"Den symbolske lenkjar <filename>%1</filename> peikar til ei mappe som ikkje "
"er med i kjeldeutvalet: <filename>%2</filename>.<nl/>Dette ønskjer du truleg "
"ikkje. Ei løysing er å ta med målmappa i utvalet."

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:421
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info message bar appearing on top"
msgid ""
"The symbolic link <filename>%1</filename> points to a file which is not "
"included: <filename>%2</filename>.<nl/>That is probably not what you want. "
"One solution is to simply include the folder where the file is stored in the "
"backup plan."
msgstr ""
"Den symbolske lenkjar <filename>%1</filename> peikar til ei fil som ikkje er "
"med i kjeldeutvalet: <filename>%2</filename>.<nl/>Dette ønskjer du truleg "
"ikkje. Ei løysing er å ta med målmappa der fila ligg, i utvalet."

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:447
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@title:window"
msgid "Select Folder"
msgstr "Vel mappe"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:483
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "Description:"
msgstr "Skildring:"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:485
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Back to overview"
msgstr "Tilbake til oversikta"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:524
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Back up multiple versions over time of the files in the source folders. This "
"allows older versions of files or deleted files to be recovered.<nl/><nl/"
">The backup archive will grow in size over time, and can only be accessed "
"using the recovery tools provided by this program."
msgstr ""
"Tek (over tid) reservekopi av fleire versjonar filene i kjelde­mappene. Dette "
"gjer at du kan gjenoppretta sletta filer og gamle versjonar av filer.<nl/"
"><nl/>Reservekopi-arkivet vil veksa i storleik over tid, og du har berre "
"tilgang til det via gjenopprettings­verktøya i dette programmet."

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:536
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@option:radio"
msgid ""
"Versioned Backup (not available because <application>bup</application> is "
"not installed)"
msgstr ""
"Reservekopi med versjonering (ikkje tilgjengeleg, då <application>bup</"
"application> ikkje er installert)"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:541
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@option:radio"
msgid "Versioned Backup (recommended)"
msgstr "Reservekopi med versjonering (tilrådd)"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:546
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Make the destination folder identical to the source folder. Files deleted "
"from a source folder will be deleted from the backup folder as well.<nl/><nl/"
">This can prevent data loss due to a broken disk, but not due to files being "
"accidentally deleted or changed."
msgstr ""
"Gjer målmappa lik kjeldemappa. Filer som vert sletta frå kjelde­mappa, vert "
"òg sletta frå målmappa.<nl/><nl/>Dette kan forhindra datatap som skuldast "
"ein øydelagd disk, men ikkje det at filer ved ein feil vert sletta eller "
"endra."

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:558
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@option:radio"
msgid ""
"Synchronized Backup (not available because <application>rsync</application> "
"is not installed)"
msgstr ""
"Synkronisert reservekopi (ikkje tilgjengeleg, då <application>rsync</"
"application> ikkje er installert)"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:563
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@option:radio"
msgid "Synchronized Backup"
msgstr "Synkronisert reservekopi"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:591
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@title"
msgid "Backup Type"
msgstr "Type reservekopi"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:592
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "Select what type of backup you want"
msgstr "Vel kva type reservekopi du vil ta"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:608
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Some files and folders (such as caches or encrypted folders) are "
"automatically excluded. You can configure this in the "
"<interface><link>Advanced</link></interface> settings."
msgstr ""
"Nokre filer og mapper (for eksempel mellomlager og krypterte mapper) vert "
"automatisk utelatne. Du kan velja om dei skal takast med under "
"<interface><link>Avansert</link></interface>-innstillingane."

# Litt tydelegare enn berre «Kjelder», og meir konsistent med neste kategori, «Målmappe». Merk elles at ein berre kan velja mapper, ikkje filer.
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:619
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@title"
msgid "Sources"
msgstr "Kjelde­mapper"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:620
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "Select which folders to include in backup"
msgstr "Vel mappene du vil ta med i reservekopien"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:635
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@option:radio"
msgid "Filesystem Path"
msgstr "Mappe på filsystemet"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:636
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@option:radio"
msgid "External Storage"
msgstr "Mappe på ekstern disk"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:642
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"You can use this option for backing up to a secondary internal harddrive, an "
"external eSATA drive or networked storage. The requirement is just that you "
"always mount it at the same path in the filesystem. The path specified here "
"does not need to exist at all times, its existence will be monitored."
msgstr ""
"Vel dette for å ta reservekopiar til ein annan intern harddisk, ein ekstern "
"eSATA-stasjon eller ein nettverks­disk. Men du må alltid montera disken på "
"same adresse i filsystemet. Adressa treng ikkje alltid vera tilgjengeleg; ho "
"vert automatisk overvaka."

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:649
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@label:textbox"
msgid "Destination Path for Backup:"
msgstr "Målmappe for reservekopiering:"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:660
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info message bar near text edit"
msgid "Only local filesystem paths will work!"
msgstr "Berre lokale filadresser kan brukast."

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:667
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info message bar near text edit"
msgid "Folder does not exist! No backups will be saved until you create it."
msgstr ""
"Mappa finst ikkje. Reservekopiar vert først tekne når du har oppretta mappa."

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:686
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Use this option if you want to backup your files on an external storage that "
"can be plugged in to this computer, such as a USB hard drive or memory stick."
msgstr ""
"Vel dette dersom du vil ta reservekopiar til ein ekstern disk, for eksempel "
"ein USB-harddisk eller ein minnepinne."

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:695 kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:698
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "The specified folder will be created if it does not exist."
msgstr "Den valde mappa vert automatisk oppretta dersom ho ikkje alt finst."

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:697
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@label:textbox"
msgid "Folder on Destination Drive:"
msgstr "Mappe på malstasjonen:"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:704
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Open dialog to select a folder"
msgstr "Opna dialogvindauge for å velja mappe"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:734
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@title"
msgid "Destination"
msgstr "Målmappe"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:735
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "Select the backup destination"
msgstr "Vel målmappe for reservekopien"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:753
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@option:radio"
msgid "Manual Activation"
msgstr "Manuell"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:754
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@option:radio"
msgid "Interval"
msgstr "Regelmessig"

# skip-rule: aktiv
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:755
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@option:radio"
msgid "Active Usage Time"
msgstr "Aktiv brukstid"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:758
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Backups are only saved when manually requested. This can be done by using "
"the Backup Status plasma widget."
msgstr ""
"Du vel sjølv når du vil ta reservekopi. Det kan du gjera via Plasma-"
"skjermelementet «Reservekopi-status»."

# «er tilgjengeleg» er meir naturleg enn «vert tilgjengeleg». Det vert jo teken reservekopi sjølv om målmappa heile tida er tilgjengeleg.
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:773
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"New backup will be triggered when backup destination becomes available and "
"more than the configured interval has passed since the last backup was saved."
msgstr ""
"Det vert teke ny reservekopi når målmappa er tilgjengeleg og det har gått så "
"lang tid sidan førre gong."

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:790
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox"
msgid "Minutes"
msgstr "Minutt"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:791 kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:818
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox"
msgid "Hours"
msgstr "Timar"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:792
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox"
msgid "Days"
msgstr "Dagar"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:793
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox"
msgid "Weeks"
msgstr "Veker"

# skip-rule: aktiv
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:803
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"New backup will be triggered when backup destination becomes available and "
"you have been using your computer actively for more than the configured time "
"limit since the last backup was saved."
msgstr ""
"Det vert teke ny reservekopi når målmappa er tilgjengeleg og du har brukt "
"maskina aktivt så lang tid sidan førre gong."

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:823
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Ask for confirmation before saving backup"
msgstr "Spør om stadfesting før reservekopiering"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:842
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@title"
msgid "Schedule"
msgstr "Tidsplan"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:843
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "Specify the backup schedule"
msgstr "Vel tidsplan for reservekopiering"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:881
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Show hidden folders in source selection"
msgstr "Vis gøymde filer ved val av kjeldemapper"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:883
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"This makes it possible to explicitly include or exclude hidden folders in "
"the backup source selection. Hidden folders have a name that starts with a "
"dot. They are typically located in your home folder and are used to store "
"settings and temporary files for your applications."
msgstr ""
"Dette gjer at du kan eksplisitt ta med eller utelata gøymde mapper i "
"reservekopien. Gøymde mapper har namn som startar med punktum. Dei finst "
"typisk i heimemappa di og vert der brukte til å lagra innstillingar og "
"mellombelse filer for programma du brukar."

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:895
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"This will make your backups use around 10% more storage space and saving "
"backups will take slightly longer time. In return it will be possible to "
"recover from a partially corrupted backup."
msgstr ""
"Dette gjer at reservekopiane tek opp om lag 10 % meir lagringsplass, og det "
"tek litt lenger tid å laga dei. Men til gjengjeld vert det mogleg å "
"gjenoppretta frå ein delvis øydelagd reservekopi."

# Har med «ekstra» for å gjera det tydelegare at det er noko meir enn det som vanlegvis trengst for å gjenoppretta ein reservekopi.
#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:903
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Generate recovery information"
msgstr "Lag ekstra gjenopprettingsinformasjon"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:906
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid ""
"Generate recovery information (not available because <application>par2</"
"application> is not installed)"
msgstr ""
"Lag ekstra gjenopprettingsinformasjon (ikkje tilgjengeleg, då "
"<application>par2</application> ikkje er installert)"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:913
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Verify integrity of backups"
msgstr "Kontroller integriteten til reservekopiane"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:915
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Checks the whole backup archive for corruption every time you save new data. "
"Saving backups will take a little bit longer time but it allows you to catch "
"corruption problems sooner than at the time you need to use a backup, at "
"that time it could be too late."
msgstr ""
"Kontrollerer heile reservekopi-arkivet etter datafeil kvar gong du tek ein "
"reservekopi. Det tek litt lenger tid å ta reservekopien, men det gjer at du "
"kan oppdaga øydelagde arkiv før du faktisk treng å bruka dei (og då kan det "
"jo vera for seint)."

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:926
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Exclude files and folders based on patterns"
msgstr "Utelat filer og mapper basert på namnemønster"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:943
#, kde-format
msgctxt "manual as in 'documentation'"
msgid "bup-index manual"
msgstr ""

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:943
#, kde-format
msgctxt "manual as in 'documentation'"
msgid "rsync manual"
msgstr ""

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:945
#, fuzzy, kde-kuit-format
#| msgctxt "@info"
#| msgid ""
#| "Patterns need to be listed in a text file with one pattern per line. "
#| "Files and folders with names that match any of the patterns will be "
#| "excluded from the backup. The pattern format is documented in the <link "
#| "url='%1'>bup-index manual page</link>."
msgctxt "@info %2 is either 'bup-index manual' or 'rsync manual'"
msgid ""
"Patterns need to be listed in a text file with one pattern per line. Files "
"and folders with names that match any of the patterns will be excluded from "
"the backup. The pattern format is documented in the <link url='%1'>%2</link>."
msgstr ""
"Mønstera må stå i ei tekstfil, eitt mønster per linje. Filer og mapper med "
"namn i samsvar med minst eitt mønster, vert automatisk utelatne frå reserve­"
"kopien. Du finn informasjon om formatet til mønstera på <link "
"url='%1'>manualsida til bup-index</link>."

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:965
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Open dialog to select a file"
msgstr "Opna dialogvindauge for å velja fil"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:967
#, kde-format
msgid "Select pattern file"
msgstr "Vel mønsterfil"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:985
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Exclude caches"
msgstr "Utelat mellomlager"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:986
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "Temporary data that can be recreated"
msgstr "Mellombelse data som kan genererast på nytt automatisk"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:995
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Exclude encrypted folders"
msgstr "Utelat krypterte mapper"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:996
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Contents of unlocked encrypted folders, such as those created with Plasma "
"Vault"
msgstr "Innhaldet i ulåste krypterte mapper, for eksempel Plasma-datakvelv"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:1004
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Exclude trash"
msgstr "Utelat papirkorga"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:1005
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "Files in trash that have not been permanently deleted"
msgstr "Filer i papirkorga som ikkje er sletta for godt"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:1014
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Exclude app states"
msgstr "Utelat programtilstandsfiler"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:1015
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"App-specific state data, such as window position, history, and open files"
msgstr ""
"Programspesifikke tilstandsdata, for eksempel om vindaugs­posisjon, "
"filhistorikk og opne filer"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:1024
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Exclude containers and virtual machine images"
msgstr "Utelat konteinarar og diskbilete for virtuelle maskiner"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:1025
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Containers or virtual machine images, such as those created by GNOME Boxes, "
"Docker, Podman, and Incus"
msgstr ""
"Konteinarar og diskbilete for virtuelle maskiner, for eksempel frå GNOME "
"Boxes, Docker, Podman eller Incus"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:1033
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Exclude snapshots"
msgstr "Utelat augeblinksbilete"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:1034
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "Btrfs filesystem snapshots"
msgstr "Augeblinksbilete av filer på filsystemet Btrfs"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:1044
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Exclude user-level Flatpaks"
msgstr "Utelat Flatpak-pakkar på brukarnivå"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:1045
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Flatpak apps and runtimes that can be re-downloaded (will not prevent "
"backing up settings and data for these apps)"
msgstr ""
"Flatpak-program og køyretids­miljø som kan lastast ned på nytt (dette hindrar "
"ikkje reserve­kopiering av innstillingar og brukar­data for desse appane)"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:1067
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@title"
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Avansert"

#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:1068
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "Extra options for advanced users"
msgstr "Ekstra val for avanserte brukarar"

# Omsetjing her må vera i samsvar med den i teksten som begynner med «Mappa finst ikkje.».
